# The image is built from what the program is made of and nothing else
# (Dockerfile): everything is left out but what is named below.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!.cargo/config.toml
!package-lock.json
!crates/
!sdk/
!vendor/
# The black-box tests are a member of the workspace: Cargo reads their
# manifest and needs their library's root to load the workspace. They are
# not built into the image.
!blackbox/Cargo.toml
!blackbox/src/
# The licence texts of what is built in and is not a crate's own
# (THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES, its second part).
!deploy/third-party-licenses/
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.DS_Store
